<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Zemivo - Memories</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial;background:#f4f6f8;color:#222}
.topbar{background:white;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;box-shadow:0 2px 8px #ddd}
.logo{font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;color:#2563eb}
.topbar a{color:#2563eb;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold}
.container{max-width:800px;margin:25px auto;padding:15px}
.card{background:white;padding:22px;border-radius:15px;margin-bottom:18px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px #ddd}
.memory{border:1px solid #eee;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:15px}
.memory h3{margin-bottom:8px}
.memory p{color:#666}
button{background:#2563eb;color:white;border:0;padding:10px 17px;border-radius:20px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header class="topbar">
<div class="logo">Zemivo</div>
<a href="index.html">🏠 Home</a>
</header>

<main class="container">

<div class="card">
<h1>🕐 Memories</h1>
<p>Look back at your previous moments and posts on Zemivo.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>Your Memories</h2>

<div class="memory">
<h3>🌍 Your Zemivo Journey</h3>
<p>Remember your first post on Zemivo.</p>
<button onclick="viewMemory(this)">View Memory</button>
</div>

<div class="memory">
<h3>📸 A Moment From The Past</h3>
<p>A previous memory is waiting for you.</p>
<button onclick="viewMemory(this)">View Memory</button>
</div>

<div class="memory">
<h3>❤️ Popular Moment</h3>
<p>See a post that received attention from your community.</p>
<button onclick="viewMemory(this)">View Memory</button>
</div>

</div>

</main>

<script>
function viewMemory(button){
button.textContent="✓ Memory Viewed";
button.disabled=true;
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
